.woff2)\n                    format(&#39;woff2&#39;),\n              }\n              @font-face {\n                font-family: &#39;Amazon Ember&#39;;\n                font-display: swap;\n                font-weight: 300;\n                src: url(https://m.media-amazon.com/images/G/01/AUIClients/AmazonUIFont-amazonember_lt-245045fa7de5df027437f47209a5add3b48108a1.woff2)\n                    format(&#39;woff2&#39;);\n              }\n              \n              body, html {\n                margin: 0;\n                font-family: &#39;Amazon Ember&#39;, arial, sans-serif;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                width: 100%;\n                height: 100%;\n              }\n            &lt;/style&gt;\n            &lt;title&gt;&lt;/title&gt;\n            \n        &lt;/head&gt;\n        &lt;body&gt;\n            \n            &lt;div id=\&quot;ad\&quot; style=\&quot;width: 100%; height: 100%;\&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=\&quot;width:100%;height:100%\&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            \n            &lt;script&gt;\n              document.getElementById(&#39;ad&#39;).setAttribute(&#39;data-script-start&#39;, window.CBCDACXRenderStartTime);\n              if (document &amp;&amp; document.fonts) {\n                try {\n                  document.fonts.ready.then(function () {\n                    document.getElementById(&#39;ad&#39;).setAttribute(&#39;data-font-loaded-time&#39;, performance.now());\n                  });\n                } catch (e) {\n                }\n              }\n            &lt;/script&gt;\n            &lt;div style=\&quot;display: none;\&quot; data-size-str=\&quot;300x250\&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            \n\n            \n            &lt;script src=\&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VLrYTq8iL.js\&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\n            &lt;script src=\&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JJ6+7j3GL.js\&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\n            &lt;script charset=\&quot;UTF-8\&quot; src=\&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/B1pT4JzSmcL.js\&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\n            &lt;script&gt;\n              window.CBCDACXBundleLoadedTime = performance.now();\n              document.getElementById(&#39;ad&#39;).setAttribute(&#39;data-bundle-loaded-time&#39;, window.CBCDACXBundleLoadedTime);\n\n              ReactDOM.hydrate(AdaptiveRenderer.default({\&quot;creativeInformation\&quot;:{\&quot;variation\&quot;:\&quot;shop-now\&quot;,\&quot;headline\&quot;:\&quot;Own Your Balance\&quot;,\&quot;customImages\&quot;:{\&quot;square\&quot;:null,\&quot;tall\&quot;:null,\&quot;wide\&quot;:null},\&quot;logoImgUrl\&quot;:\&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/al-na-9d5791cf-3faf/c57dd3fd-77ec-466c-95b2-27c247754a1e.png\&quot;,\&quot;isPreview\&quot;:false,\&quot;priceInformation\&quot;:{\&quot;price\&quot;:229.99,\&quot;fullPrice\&quot;:null,\&quot;pricePerUnit\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;currencyCode\&quot;:\&quot;USD\&quot;},\&quot;isPrimeEligible\&quot;:true,\&quot;productDescription\&quot;:\&quot;GIBBON Home Board\&quot;,\&quot;ratings\&quot;:{\&quot;stars\&quot;:4.3,\&quot;amount\&quot;:100},\&quot;dealBadge\&quot;:{},\&quot;aapiBrandName\&quot;:\&quot;GIBBON\&quot;,\&quot;ctaText\&quot;:\&quot;shop-now\&quot;,\&quot;productGroupType\&quot;:\&quot;gl_sports\&quot;,\&quot;resolvedAceiData\&quot;:{\&quot;renderFeatureFlags\&quot;:{},\&quot;renderLogData\&quot;:{\&quot;eligibleSCE\&quot;:[],\&quot;metrics\&quot;:[]},\&quot;aceiExperimentsToRecord\&quot;:{}},\&quot;asin\&quot;:\&quot;B0FFDVD8QV\&quot;,\&quot;productQnADetails\&quot;:{\&quot;productQnA\&quot;:[{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;How does the low profile reduce fall risk?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The SlackBoard Plus uses a low-profile design that keeps users close to the ground, which directly reduces the distance and impact of any potential fall. This design choice makes it safer for beginners building confidence, as well as for kids and adults working on coordination and motor skills. The cork bottom also adds a secure grip on hardwood floors, carpets, grass, and outdoor patios, further stabilizing the board during use.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;How does the cork bottom grip surfaces?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The cork bottom provides a solid grip across a wide range of surfaces, including hardwood floors, carpets, grass, and outdoor patios. This material choice ensures the board stays secure during dynamic movements without slipping, whether used indoors or outside. The low-profile design further complements this by keeping users close to the ground.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;How does the 2-line setup improve balance?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The 2-line board setup provides extra stability and versatility compared to a single-line configuration, making it accessible for all ages and skill levels. This setup helps beginners build confidence while still allowing experienced users to refine their techniques. It&#39;s the recommended starting point for anyone new to balance board training.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;How does it prep you for snow sports?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The SlackBoard Plus is designed as a dedicated snowboard, ski, and ice skating trainer, helping users build the coordination and motor skills that translate directly to snow sports. Its low-profile design keeps you close to the ground, reducing fall risk while you practice balance and edge control at home. The 2-line board setup offers extra stability for beginners building confidence, while experienced riders can use it to refine technique between seasons.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;Does the 2-line setup boost stability?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The 2-line board setup is specifically designed to provide extra stability and versatility across all ages and skill levels. This configuration is particularly recommended for beginners, as it helps build confidence before progressing to more advanced techniques. The setup also supports experienced users looking to refine their balance skills.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;How durable is the maple wood build?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The SlackBoard Plus is crafted from sustainably USA-sourced American maple wood, chosen for long-term durability even with daily use. It supports up to 400 lbs without compromising safety, and the thoughtful construction is described as built for performance across a wide range of activities. A cork bottom adds grip stability on hardwood floors, carpet, grass, and outdoor patios, reducing wear from varied surfaces.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;How does it work at a standing desk?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The SlackBoard Plus is designed to sit under a standing desk, letting you engage your core and improve balance while you work. Its low-profile design keeps you close to the ground, which helps reduce the risk of falls during extended use. The cork bottom provides a solid grip on hardwood floors and carpets — common surfaces in home offices — so the board stays stable beneath you.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;Does it work for all skill levels?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The SlackBoard Plus is designed for all skill levels, from beginners to experienced users. Its innovative 2-line board setup offers extra stability, helping beginners build confidence while still allowing experienced users to refine techniques. The low-profile design keeps users close to the ground, reducing fall risk as skills develop.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;}]},\&quot;productTitleType\&quot;:\&quot;SHORTENED\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;DISPLAY\&quot;,\&quot;productImg\&quot;:{\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sgBbKK6QL.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;altText\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;colorTreatment\&quot;:\&quot;default\&quot;},\&quot;videos\&quot;:[],\&quot;components\&quot;:[\&quot;Image\&quot;,\&quot;BuyBox\&quot;,\&quot;Headline\&quot;,\&quot;Logo\&quot;],\&quot;border\&quot;:true,\&quot;storeContextName\&quot;:\&quot;Balance Boards (Sports &amp; Outdoors)\&quot;,\&quot;clickThroughInfo\&quot;:{\&quot;impressionUrls\&quot;:[],\&quot;isOffsite\&quot;:false,\&quot;adLink\&quot;:\&quot;https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FFDVD8QV?aref=C8TKo5O1XW&amp;aaxitk=1fd0a5e6fa7420906d163b323f886bb2&amp;language=en_US&amp;pd_rd_plhdr=t&amp;ref=dacx_dp_591279318590229397_581794190641022197\&quot;,\&quot;reviewLink\&quot;:\&quot;https://www.amazon.com/product-reviews/B0FFDVD8QV?aref=C8TKo5O1XW&amp;aaxitk=1fd0a5e6fa7420906d163b323f886bb2&amp;language=en_US\&quot;,\&quot;buttonLink\&quot;:\&quot;https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FFDVD8QV?aref=C8TKo5O1XW&amp;aaxitk=1fd0a5e6fa7420906d163b323f886bb2&amp;language=en_US&amp;pd_rd_plhdr=t&amp;ref=dacx_dp_591279318590229397_581794190641022197\&quot;,\&quot;clickUrls\&quot;:[\&quot;https://aax-events-cell01-cf.us-east.ono.axp.amazon-adsystem.com/x/c/RNFhLLG6PAdmDzl-vPNC1GUAAAGhClXKpgEAAAH0BABvbm9fdHhuX2JpZDEgICBvbm9fdHhuX2ltcDEgICDcwTwU/clv1c_ek-g33sxHdDCy7nFk0GOu1MboJSaClaCIJsGD16h4VGpFjQUWtKq8FmMVhDWb4Z4hBKBUhz4MMdjn8zxza4YjSawJ1i9CFZ9Pq3kWQYHJxyz4W8cL5mRNQigQTTthWBLt5Q9le_MhoXwPMRYKaVEFdfyd_C13U-iIhQxLbj-ABunPOMYryXXCAI9RqQ-PiNWyj6z6PqQqlTqRnfw6r_U6wPSkpBXZvBipBYCHvT497TM2moJ7Tsb6QYKr8M0HOPlkH5ULHaCyoDkZAGqWkLa7BF67lEsUHbhv3hrtVmkmybEzcfbTrU-OnVg8Qr5pVijDI9ABtdWUoyDIMe5N5x6DMVCysp4QphW_SPH_qY7K9pv5U4i7nv_prua8N81q_PihqtBmz-gcGHJKB6nzd5IV6hG8WK6UismoLch9yNShe3mT7RtrrCSFw2rUaikCR2osc9xI9KLd-8CSUADJDOTdBuMmnLo7lcuaYyWlyXJ60Ha6o0ADIx5gV7_jKdCKvwprVdN5SjO0huUHx4MEOUHs1p4ccIeEYabjEVwb-tCmfIBorE5qoTcClXshBnDUzD_Xm216MRY7fEsJdz9gGtl74SIOK55YY7wyw8OGD_hLHLs5291ThphjBcYBoT6